line	<col=000080>Bring him 32&nbsp;kg of sandstone, it doesn't have to be all at once. You can break down big pieces with a chisel.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Lazim north-east of the quarry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring him 32&nbsp;kg of sandstone, it doesn't have to be all at once. You can break down big pieces with a chisel.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use your chisel on the sandstone (32&nbsp;kg).</col>
